OL,3,GNEWSAFormer health secretary calls for 
OL,4,Asackings over NHS Grampian deaths      
OL,6,FA former health secretary has called   
OL,7,Ffor NHS and government staff to be held
OL,8,Faccountable and, in extreme cases, lose
OL,9,Ftheir jobs after a leaked report showed
OL,10,Fdeaths at a health board could have    
OL,11,Fbeen avoided.                          
OL,13,FAlex Neil, who was health secretary    
OL,14,Ffrom 2012 to 2014 under then first     
OL,15,Fminister Alex Salmond, said the NHS    
OL,16,FGrampian affair "stinks" of either a   
OL,17,Fcover-up or "extreme incompetence".    
