OL,3,GNEWSAFormer health secretary calls for 
OL,4,Asackings over NHS Grampian deaths      
OL,6,FIt came after a whistleblower leaked a 
OL,7,F2022 review which found 19 avoidable   
OL,8,Fdeaths among 45 patients in liver and  
OL,9,Fpancreatic surgery at Aberdeen Royal   
OL,10,FInfirmary.                             
OL,12,FAngela Constance, the current health   
OL,13,Fsecretary, has denied a cover-up and   
OL,14,Fordered an independent review into     
OL,15,Fhepatobiliary surgery at the health    
OL,16,Fboard.                                 
